        <p>The prevailing designs are so neat and light as to be almost invisible, therefore,</p>
        <p>nothing could be more ac-</p>
        <p>ceptable to the Spectacle Wearer than a pair of these modern eye helps. Any necessary alterations are afterwards made free of</p>
