        <p>that he was really .pleased that there were so many there who had survived their "black hole of Calcutta"—(laughter)--of the days gone hY• - he was glad they had with them Mr. Holland; ;Seeing that he was a Wesleyan he thought hi"' visit showed the good spirit that existed between the denominations.</p>
