        <p>"There was a scalding pain when passing thi,° urinary excretions; they were discoloured, all contained a dark, heavy sediment. I got n° better while I was having medical treatment;. but one day I picked up a booklet, and reau about a woman who had been cured by Doan Backache Kidney Pills, and began to use thew-, "By the time I had used two boxes I coal" tell that I had got the right medicine. With every box I got better still, and I can truly saY that I have derived wonderful benefit from the medicine. I am now feeling in better health than I have done for years, and it is all due to Doan 's pills. I shall always be grateful for what they have done for me. (Signed) Mrs- Jackson.' NEARLY TWO YEARS LATER, Mrs. Jackson says: am pleased to say that I am keeping in go°( health, thanks to Doan's Backache Kidney Pills' I would .not be without a box in the house Or anything." ii Price 2s. 9d. a. box, 6 boxes 13s. 9d., of dealers, or from Foster-McClellan Co.. 8, We",ic street, Oxford-street. ,London. W. Don't a' r for backache and kidney pills—ask nisTtsell', for DOAN'S Backache Kidney Pills, the same 0' Mrs. Jackson had.</p>
