      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-12-13_WidnesExaminer_art0255" n="art0255">
        <head>CORONER CONDEMNS WIDNES GAS.</head>
        <p>CORONER CONDEMNS WIDNES GAS.</p>
        <p>At an inquest in Widnes, Coroner Brighouia' made caustic allusions to the quality of the Widnes gas. " The last time I was here," he said, "I com- plained of the gas in this court. VU briog sonie burners down with me the next time I come."</p>
        <p>A Juryman: It's very indifferent gas. The Coroner: I've seen it mentioned that Widnes is proud of producing the cheapest g3'l -on earth. - Do you get gas like- this in Your shops? Another Juryman: It's a jolly sight worse. The Coroner: Oh, it's not the burners, Oleo:. .1. should not like to say publicly what I thini` about it.</p>
